  "priorExpiration": "2003-02-22",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 621.05 Notification to EPA. The department shall submit to EPA:\n\n(a) Copies of the public notice and the draft temporary permit, draft permit to operate, or draft decision and findings of fact within 10 days of completion of the draft; and\n\n(b) Copies of the final temporary permit, final permit to operate, or final decision and findings of fact within 10 days of issuance.\n\nSource. #5989, eff 2-22-95; EXPIRED: 2-22-03\n\nNew. #8129, eff 7-28-04 (formerly Env-A 205.05); ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
